/* Learning Data: The map before the data. The words of the series' labs (Take it apart) and scenarios (Make the call), in English.
   Keep the keys in step with learn.es.js. One playground for each film (the author, 18 November 2026), each on the chapter it plays
   (film, chapter), with four experiments (w.goals) the visitor ticks by making them happen; and eight situations, one from every
   film, the series' evaluation, each pointing to its playground. The old sorting and dealing labs (13, until 19 November 2026) became
   these playgrounds and situations; ArchiMate 4's changes, which the films don't state, are tested in situation 72 (and taught in
   Business architecture for data's rule playground, with its film).
   learn.js draws every picture from these words and keeps progress in this browser under "ld-enterprise-architecture": the labs
   visited, the experiments ticked, and the answers by scenario number (film × 10 + its place). A page shows each situation's options
   in the order written here: the right answers are spread across the places, and the Spanish pack keeps them in the same places.
   build_series.py (series_learn) reads the first keys of each lab, in this order: id, kind, film, chapter, c, name; and of each
   scenario: type, n, lab, film. No other object here starts with id, and no other key is called kind or starts an object with type.
   check_site.py reads the lab ids that the films' Pause and think questions stop at: pile, place.
   Names and numbers follow the films: Tomás, Grace, Farah, Ama, the head of retail; 140 systems; 34 working days to connect new
   solar, against a goal of 10; three faults and two crews at 2:15 a.m.; the four things that cross the wall; the social tariff from
   1 July. On 23 November 2026 three films left, with their labs and situations: film 11, A map people and agents can read, to open
   Continuous architecture, and films 8 and 9, Now the questions appear and Rules with a home, to Business architecture for data, as its
   films 5 and 6; When strategy moves became film 8. moved sends an old link to them on to that series' pages, and renum moves a
   visitor's answers once to the new numbers (the situations of films 8 and 9, 81 and 94, left; 101 is now 81), keeping the answers
   as they were under "quiz-before-1", where Business architecture for data finds the two that went to it. */
